OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 14, stabbed 55 times by
OL,4,A14-year-old boy, murder trial told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage girl was stabbed "around 55
OL,7,Ftimes" by a 14-year-old boy, a murder
OL,8,Ftrial has been told.
OL,10,FLilly Jones, from Blaina, in Blaenau
OL,11,FGwent, was stabbed in the heart and
OL,12,Fboth lungs as well as an artery in her
OL,13,Fneck. There were 17 stab wounds to her
OL,14,Fneck, and knife wounds were found on
OL,15,Fher face, jaw, chest and bottom.
OL,17,FShe had left her home at about 18:30 on
OL,18,F20 June, telling her father she was
OL,19,F"popping out for a bit".
